{560}{}{Firstly, the patient needs to drink a cup of marking fluid, which prepares their circulatory system. As an experienced doctor, I can guide the Auto-Doc to a certain extent by adjusting the settings while they are inside. However, I can't guarantee the same results for everyone; the patient's body determines the outcome.}
